OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for causing death of
OL,4,Aboy in collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who caused the death of a
OL,7,Ffive-year-old boy after he ignored a no
OL,8,Fentry sign on a street in Leeds has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed for six years.
OL,11,FColin Agyei, 32, of Pear Tree Grove,
OL,12,FKnottingley, was driving his Nissan
OL,13,FNote when he collided with Abdullah
OL,14,FEbrahim as he ran across Back Camberley
OL,15,FStreet in Beeston on 7 July 2022.
OL,17,FLeeds Crown Court heard the road was
OL,18,Frarely used by vehicles and Abdullah
OL,19,Fdid not have time to react. He was
OL,20,Ftaken to hospital but died shortly
OL,21,Fafterwards.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
